{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（30日）上午10時50分，警方接報上水清曉路一個地盤發生工業意外。據報一名工人遭鐵枝插傷下顎，繼而墮地。人員到場將他救起，送往沙田威爾斯醫院治理，案件列工業意外跟進。</p><figure><img alt=\"鐵支上有敷料。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192811681449775104192380.jpeg/JdVPwcKwzYHt3TXU73DiXgc-orMX8I02t7sDRbe7A0U\"/><figcaption>鐵支上有敷料。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鐵支上有敷料。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192811699812962304568420.jpeg/l62W5KJv8xtcaRBAfMRl1kI1K2Qa9h7Y9RQGmPUUBpg\"/><figcaption>鐵支上有敷料。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><p>現場是房屋署的地盤，正進行地基工程，插有大量鋼筋。事故原因有待調查，勞工處及警方正在跟進。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場是房署的地盤。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192811697153642496603589.jpeg/PowXiHfbhksRTtxyOpTjuQXVRnROy9gUHYJCkx2CQpM\"/><figcaption>現場是房署的地盤。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人員在場調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192811694439796736085176.jpeg/thwuouWm_z3uYiF0-oINxfMn_vQhGlc_6QIP1ukCD9Y\"/><figcaption>人員在場調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是房署的地盤。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192811691642064896537294.jpeg/YFnMuX9lOvAYMsQE8hKGW8tQO1SKcOSTAp-_UwKfv1M\"/><figcaption>現場是房署的地盤。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是房署的地盤。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192811688013860864219573.jpeg/TFJ5MdOwGXdC6_evl9MI-EK5yBDdjxjdzJxPfsycT34\"/><figcaption>現場是房署的地盤。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者送到沙田威爾斯醫院治理。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192803670081671168239017.jpeg/9zt2KHZBG7dcDxpoIeBEek6OSuDBijCx_L43V_y-N1c\"/><figcaption>傷者送到沙田威爾斯醫院治理。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T04:41:45.706646+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":243,"images":7,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T03:43:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T04:38:45.752106+00:00",